// rdfs:comment "One item response within the PedsQL age-banded QoL inventory. The gist:hasAspect value identifies the specific item via its REDCap column number. Physical items: walking, running, sport, lifting, bathing/chores, aches, fatigue. Emotional items: fear, sadness, anger, sleep, worry. Social items: peer relationships, teasing, keeping up. School/Work items: attention, forgetting, keeping up, absences."
